Findfie3.txt   Corrections to warning in FindFie2.txt.
Findfiel.bug   Original warning of bug in FINDFIELD.
Fontform.txt   Description of the format of font files.
Format.opl     Code to format a disk in drive B, using I/O calls.
Fsize.opl       Proc  to  return  size  of  file  specified  as  a
parameter.

